<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE - No stats office data next week.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE - No stats office data next week.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Federal Statistics Office said on Friday it did not plan to publish any economic indicators next week.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
